  {
   "key": "func FitnessPostSummaryView.backfillAnalysisSnapshotIfNeeded()",
   "hash": "347603a4c5eda062",
   "does": "If the stored analysisSnapshot is missing or needsRebuild (older schema or different narrative language), builds a new WorkoutAnalysisSnapshot on a detached task and, when the session has samples, writes it to the archive there too (persistAnalysisSnapshot, which skips the write when the archived samples/duration changed meanwhile). Only the newest build (analysisGeneration) lands: it becomes builtAnalysis whether or not it was written; when written, refreshedSession is set and the archive-change signal bumped.",
   "entry": "Spawned from invalidateCachedExports, after each reload that applied a copy.",
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Models/WorkoutAnalysisSnapshot.swift::var WorkoutAnalysisSnapshot.needsRebuild",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Views/FitnessPostSummaryView+Feeling.swift::func FitnessPostSummaryView.snapshotInputs()",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/WorkoutAnalysisSnapshotBuilder.swift::func WorkoutAnalysisSnapshotBuilder.build(_:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Views/FitnessPostSummaryView+Feeling.swift::func FitnessPostSummaryView.persistAnalysisSnapshot(_:builtFrom:id:archive:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Collection/RRCollector+Session.swift::func RRCollector.notifyArchiveChanged()",
    "ext:Task.detached"
   ],
   "reads": [
    "mem:AppDependencies.storage.sessionArchive"
   ],
   "writes": [
    "mem:FitnessPostSummaryView.analysisGeneration",
    "mem:FitnessPostSummaryView.builtAnalysis",
    "mem:FitnessPostSummaryView.refreshedSession",
    "mem:ArchiveSignal.version"
   ],
   "branches": [
    {
     "at": "+2",
     "cond": "stored snapshot exists",
     "effect": "true: needsRebuild decides; false: rebuild"
    },
    {
     "at": "+3",
     "cond": "needsRebuild AND inputs",
     "effect": "false: return without work"
    },
    {
     "at": "+11",
     "cond": "session has samples",
     "effect": "true: persist after building; false: build only"
    },
    {
     "at": "+14",
     "cond": "a newer backfill started meanwhile",
     "effect": "return; nothing lands"
    },
    {
     "at": "+16",
     "cond": "nothing written (no samples, stale or failed)",
     "effect": "return after setting builtAnalysis"
    }
   ],
   "deps": {
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/WorkoutAnalysisSnapshotBuilder.swift::func WorkoutAnalysisSnapshotBuilder.build(_:)": "46c043c65e0927e3",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Collection/RRCollector+Session.swift::func RRCollector.notifyArchiveChanged()": "9da962f96226ecdd",
